" begin="00:32.710" end="00:35.430">Uh, it don't matter who you fuckin', lil' baby, 'cause I hit it first (okay)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.430" end="00:36.930">Baby, I'ma put it to work (okay)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.870" end="00:40.150">I'm just tryna get up under your skirt (oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.150" end="00:42.350">Huh, okay, for sure (for sure)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.350" end="00:45.700">Uh, lil' shawty, she got cake, tryna eat me like dessert (okay, for sure)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.700" end="00:48.360">Shawty got a pretty face, I could tell that she a flirt (okay, okay)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.360" end="00:51.000">Huh, no, I can't give you my heart, my ex bitch did me the worst</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.000" end="00:52.500">But you could swing my- (oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.490" end="00:54.160">Huh, you can swing my way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.160" end="00:55.780">Tell me what you wanna- (ooh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.780" end="00:57.370">Tell me what you wanna say (okay)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.370" end="01:00.420">We can hop up in that coupe and we can go to outerspace</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.420" end="01:03.620">Or you can stay home with that nigga who don't take you on no dates</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.620" end="01:05.170">It's your way, okay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.170" end="01:07.260">Yeah, tell me, what we doin'? (tell me, what we doin'?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.260" end="01:08.760">We can get into it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.540" end="01:10.040">Makin' movies, Stanley Kubrick</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.860" end="01:11.420">If I tell her do it, she gon' do it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.420" end="01:13.060">Uh, all we rock is double C</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.060" end="01:15.180">Stay with the gang like it's a unit (huh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.180" end="01:16.6